Subject: [PATCH] firewall4: refresh fullcone patch config hunk for 2026-11-08

ImmortalWrt a4ba8240d8 ships firewall4 2026-11-08~3722eadc (bumped in
dab12e766366) but has not refreshed its bundled fullcone patch. Upstream
removed the "# option disable_ipv6" stub from root/etc/config/firewall, so
001-firewall4-add-support-for-fullcone-nat.patch fails its first hunk
("Hunk #1 FAILED at 5") and firewall4 cannot build.

Retarget that hunk at the new default-config context so the fullcone and
flow-offloading defaults still land in /etc/config/firewall. The remaining
hunks apply unchanged apart from their usual offsets.

This is a local workaround for the pinned master baseline. Delete it once
ImmortalWrt commits its own "firewall4: refresh fullcone patches" for this
snapshot; the patch is then expected to fail and should be dropped.
---
diff --git a/package/network/config/firewall4/patches/001-firewall4-add-support-for-fullcone-nat.patch b/package/network/config/firewall4/patches/001-firewall4-add-support-for-fullcone-nat.patch
index 05e6c4d..5d8f76e 100644
--- a/package/network/config/firewall4/patches/001-firewall4-add-support-for-fullcone-nat.patch
+++ b/package/network/config/firewall4/patches/001-firewall4-add-support-for-fullcone-nat.patch
@@ -22,10 +22,8 @@ Renew: ZiMing Mo <msylgj@immortalwrt.org>
 
 --- a/root/etc/config/firewall
 +++ b/root/etc/config/firewall
-@@ -5,6 +5,10 @@ config defaults
+@@ -5,4 +5,8 @@ config defaults
  	option forward		REJECT
- # Uncomment this line to disable ipv6 rules
- #	option disable_ipv6	1
 +	option flow_offloading	1
 +	option flow_offloading_hw	1
 +	option fullcone		1
